# Enter the Talekeeper (Bastok 8-2, mission.bastok.enter_the_talekeeper) played through: a level 75 Bastokan Warrior at
# rank 8 with the ASA, ACP, RoV and SoA logs current (their zone-ins quiet) and the nation's missions before it
# completed. Rashid's 1001, option 21: begun; Rashid says EXTENDED_MISSION_OFFSET + 12. Zeruhn Mines: Drake Fang 202
# (status 1), 203. Kuftal Tunnel: qm6 says its own text at status 1; qm5 12, option 0: status 2 and FELL; qm6 with no
# ghost up spawns the three (no claim) and says EVIL; each ghost's death with none alive sets status 3; qm6 13: the Old
# Piece of Wood, status 4. Drake Fang 204: status 5 (his finish's setPos); a warp into Bastok Mines from Zeruhn Mines:
# the zone-in plays 176, its finish: completed (80000 gil, rank 9), the wood taken. Section 3 (completed, The Salt of
# the Earth not): Detzo 184 (importantOnce: his own 30 next), Gumbah's talk goes to Blade of Darkness's 99 (a quest's
# progress event above the mission's 183), Pavvke 76, Iron Eater 769.
char zone=BastokMines pos=-6,-2,-123 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers completed
mission Bastok ToTheForsakenMines completed
mission Bastok Jeuno completed
mission Bastok Magicite completed
